# Minesweeper: Esc (the boss key) minimizes it; Alt and R on the active icon change nothing. Same keys
# as g.scn, run on real 3.11 as winmine-g (01 the start, 02 the icon; no frame after it).
# The icon and its title are left out of the comparison: they need USER's icon windows (36 x 36 at the
# slot of USER seg4:0000) and icon titles in libw16, which this branch does not have - UNTESTED here.
# regress: sh apps/winmine/tests/run.sh "$TEST" "$OUT"
# compare: winmine-g/02.png 01.png ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 4 404 76 462
# compare: winmine-g/02.png 02.png ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 4 404 76 462
# compare: winmine-g/02.png 03.png ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 4 404 76 462
sleep 400
key esc
sleep 400
shot shots/01.png
key alt
sleep 400
shot shots/02.png
key r
sleep 400
shot shots/03.png
quit
